{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n 11 \u2014 A3 Pron\u00f3stico (Fase 5, lista para revisi\u00f3n)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_medidas_mas_norte", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n 1: pronosticar 'Medidas + norte'", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El sur no tiene ocupaci\u00f3n oficial 2025\u20132026; solo se pronostican series medidas que llegan a 2026. Descartadas: solo INAH (Chetumal sin serie) y estimar ocupaci\u00f3n del sur _est (contradice Fase 3, solo 36 meses)."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_serie_inah_oxtankah", "label": "Serie de visitantes INAH a Oxtankah (Bah\u00eda Calderitas\u2013Oxtankah)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_serie_inah_ruta_sur", "label": "Serie de visitantes INAH Kohunlich + Dzibanch\u00e9 + Ichkabal (Ruta arqueol\u00f3gica del sur)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_cruces_belice", "label": "Serie de cruces desde Belice (Chetumal)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L21", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_ocupacion_cancun_referencia", "label": "Ocupaci\u00f3n hotelera de Canc\u00fan (serie de referencia)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Es el p\u00fablico de la campa\u00f1a: indica en qu\u00e9 meses se llena el norte, cuando m\u00e1s gente se puede redirigir al sur."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_hueco_tren_maya", "label": "Hueco: Tren Maya con menos de 24 meses (variable, no se pronostica)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L32", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_hueco_forma_del_ano", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n 2: 'Hueco + forma del a\u00f1o' (meses cerrados no entrenan)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L36", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un mes cerrado no es cero demanda; si entrenara, el modelo aprender\u00eda una temporada falsa. Descartadas: solo desde la reapertura (19 meses < 24) y ceros como dato real."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_regla_cierre_mes_parcial", "label": "Reglas de cierre y mes parcial", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L47", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pandemia_parametros", "label": "Par\u00e1metros PANDEMIA_INAH y PANDEMIA_BELICE", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_belice_pandemia_hasta_jun_2022", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n: mar\u2013jun 2022 de Belice cuentan como pandemia", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L101", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Con el fin en feb-2022, STL confund\u00eda la recuperaci\u00f3n (65\u201382 % de 2019) con temporada (corr 0.446). Con el corte en jun-2022 la correlaci\u00f3n sube a 0.847; Belice entrena 62 meses en vez de 66."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_region_suma_zonas", "label": "Regla: regi\u00f3n = suma de sus zonas", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Si una zona existente est\u00e1 cerrada, se marca todo el mes de la regi\u00f3n: sumar solo las abiertas bajar\u00eda el total artificialmente."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pronostico_series_parquet", "label": "datos/gold/pronostico_series.parquet", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L65", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_descomposicion_estacional", "label": "Pieza 2: descomposici\u00f3n estacional (forma y fuerza de la temporada)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L80", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Se usa descomposici\u00f3n cl\u00e1sica multiplicativa en lugar de STL porque STL exige serie continua y tirar\u00eda los a\u00f1os posteriores a los huecos; STL queda como segunda opini\u00f3n. Descartado: 'meses de oportunidad' con umbral sobre Canc\u00fan (variaba con diferencias de 0.02)."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pronostico_forma_anio_parquet", "label": "datos/gold/pronostico_forma_anio.parquet", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L81", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_holt_winters_forma_fija_decision", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n t\u00e9cnica: Holt-Winters con forma del a\u00f1o fija", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L137", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Holt-Winters cl\u00e1sico necesita \u2265 24 meses seguidos y desde las reaperturas solo hay 20 (Bah\u00eda) y 17 (Ruta); la variante sin tendencia naci\u00f3 del diagn\u00f3stico de \u2212240 visitantes pronosticados."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_regresion_con_clima", "label": "Regresi\u00f3n con clima", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L134", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Elegida en Bah\u00eda, Ruta y Belice; la ganancia viene de la estructura (nivel por tramo + mes), no del clima."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_gradient_boosting_rezagos", "label": "Gradient Boosting con rezagos", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L135", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_menor_error_rango_80", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n: 'Menor error con rango \u2265 80 %'", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L143", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Por serie, menor MAE entre modelos con cobertura \u2265 80 %. Descartadas: menor error sin importar el rango (HW sin tendencia en la Ruta acierta su rango 72/100) y un solo modelo para todo (en Canc\u00fan la regresi\u00f3n comete 58 % m\u00e1s error)."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_ruta_cobertura_2023", "label": "Hallazgo: la Ruta no llega a 90 % de cobertura (ca\u00edda de 2023)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L159", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_clima_casi_no_mejora", "label": "Hallazgo: el clima casi no mejora el pron\u00f3stico", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L162", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pronostico_mes_parquet", "label": "datos/gold/pronostico_mes.parquet", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L122", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_supuesto_con_barrido", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n: tormentas 'Supuesto con barrido'", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L183", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La probabilidad est\u00e1 medida (Poisson, 31 eventos) pero el efecto no: solo 3 meses con tormenta entrenan (Earl 2016, Franklin 2017, Lisa 2022). Descartado: mostrar solo la probabilidad."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_campana_en_fase_6", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n: efecto de la campa\u00f1a se ve en la Fase 6", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L188", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los escenarios son 'lo que pasar\u00eda de todos modos'; meter un efecto supuesto (+5 %, +10 %) mezclar\u00eda un pron\u00f3stico medido con un n\u00famero sin fuente."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_capacidad_probada", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n: 'Capacidad probada' (mes m\u00e1s alto ya recibido)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L192", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mismo criterio que la selecci\u00f3n de regiones: Ruta 10,465 (ene-2018), Bah\u00eda 1,639 (abr-2017), Belice 65,792 (ago-2025). Descartados: cuartos de hotel (no son visitantes a zonas) y dejarlo para la Fase 6."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_tormentas_pesan_en_el_mes", "label": "Hallazgo: las tormentas pesan en el mes, no en el a\u00f1o", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L209", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Con \u03b4 = 50 % el escenario probable anual baja solo 1.2\u20132.3 %; la reserva de la Fase 6 debe ser por mes (agosto\u2013octubre)."}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_riesgo_capacidad_meses_pico", "label": "Hallazgo: riesgo de capacidad en meses pico (dic-2026, ene-2027)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L212", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_fase_6_campana", "label": "Fase 6 (asignaci\u00f3n de la campa\u00f1a y presupuesto)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_medidas_mas_norte", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L13", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_serie_inah_oxtankah", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_serie_inah_ruta_sur", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L20", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_cruces_belice", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L21", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_ocupacion_cancun_referencia", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_hueco_tren_maya", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L32", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_hueco_forma_del_ano", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L36", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_regla_cierre_mes_parcial", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L47", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pandemia_parametros", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L51", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_belice_pandemia_hasta_jun_2022", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L101", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_region_suma_zonas", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L60", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pronostico_series_parquet", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L65", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_descomposicion_estacional", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L80", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_pronostico_forma_anio_parquet", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L81", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_holt_winters_forma_fija_decision", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L137", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_regresion_con_clima", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/decisiones/11-pronostico.md", "source_location": "L134", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico", "target": "docs_decisiones_11_pronostico_gradient_bo